                                                "sense_id": "a28abaf9-4c18-3d25-ba4f-b7957bbbf8bf",
                                                "text": "After intelligence indicated that the Germans were using the unshelled route almost exclusively, Uniacke would quickly shift all his guns there, with disastrous effects for the Germans."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
